%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7087a33b9b694f98874cb605de3959ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: OnboardingDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Lisa
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9145949f82f262b42a935c86b39eeb21, type: 3}
  entries:
  - text: 'Hi! Im Lisa, I''ll help you make the right moves to improve your profile
      so that the Hiring manager can headhunt you and call you in for an interview


      Let''s
      look at your profile then, shall we?'
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: The current job market is so competitive, but with the right cards you
      can land your next position in a flash. When you click on an event you'll gain
      a card and learn a skill
    panelToActivate: 2
    showCharacter: 0
  - text: Showing that you're constantly applying yourself, towards your interests
      is what recruiters like to see
    panelToActivate: 2
    showCharacter: 0
  - text: This is what your CV will look like, and it will be a representation of
      all the skills you've gained over the years
    panelToActivate: 1
    showCharacter: 0
  - text: 'Soft skills build shields that help you deal with tough questions, hard
      skills helps you display your understanding of concepts. '
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: Your access skills are all the great things you've done and can talk about
      to build yourself up.
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: "When you play cards of the same type together (e.g three hard skill cards
      to answer a question), they become stronger, and the same goes for cards of
      similar skill tags. \n\n"
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: If you dont like the cards in your hand, you can discard one card per turn
      to try improve your options, but it will cost you some composure
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: 'I think thats all for now.


      When you''re ready, you can go in to
      meet the hiring manager about the job.'
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
  - text: 'Remember to take it easy, failure is part of the learning process.



      You''ll
      get better as you go along'
    panelToActivate: 0
    showCharacter: 1
